<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 24px; color: #1a1a1a;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px; color: #c2410c;">A second heads-up about your payment</h1>
    <p>Hi{{#if recipient_name}} {{recipient_name}}{{/if}},</p>
    <p>We still haven't been able to collect <strong>{{amount_display}}</strong> for your Growth Project subscription. Your access is open as usual today &mdash; we just want to flag that if the charge doesn't go through, the subscription is scheduled to end on <strong>{{cancellation_date}}</strong>{{#if coach_name}}, which would pause your work with {{coach_name}}{{/if}}.</p>
    <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
      <a href="{{billing_portal_url}}" style="display: inline-block; background: #c2410c; color: #fff; padding: 12px 22px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;">Update payment</a>
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #555;">Most of the time it's a card that expired or a billing address that doesn't match &mdash; both take a minute in the portal. There's still room to fix this before the cutoff.</p>
    <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eaeaea; margin: 32px 0;" />
    <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #888;">Reply to this email if anything looks off &mdash; a human reads every reply.</p>
  </body>
</html>
